B.bPp=s(["Every day, Mia uses kind words.","In the morning she says, \u201cGood morning, everyone!\u201d","When she wants something, she says \u201cplease.\u201d","When someone helps her, she says \u201cthank you.\u201d","When she makes a mistake, she says \u201csorry\u201d to her friend."],t.s)
